### Private release signing (examples/soccer-football) ###
# The shared dev key at sdk/keys/lightsdk-dev.jks stays committed on purpose (it's a known, public
# test key); a private release keystore must never be. See keystore.properties.example.
examples/soccer-football/keystore.properties
examples/soccer-football/*.jks